                                "sense_id": "2b9aab41-d001-3f01-a550-627606ce9a53",
                                "text": "On many farms the early milkhouse and pumphouse were one. Most farmers during the latter part of the nineteenth and beginning of the twentieth centuries with a herd of milk cows had a milkhouse."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
